&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deep industry expertise in physical operations and operational workflow redesign.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience designing customer value frameworks and multi-year operational transformation roadmaps.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proficiency in advanced data analysis for value quantification and outcome measurement.&lt;/li&gt;
