&lt;li&gt;Confident in electronic &amp;amp; system integration and specification&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in field operations coordination, implementation, and technical deployment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Interest in AI with the view to create tooling to operate at scale&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong attention to detail with the ability to manage multiple projects in parallel&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent communication and stakeholder management skills&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfortable in a dynamic, fast-paced environment with cross-functional collaboration&lt;/li&gt;
