&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hire, onboard, develop and lead an inclusive, engaged, and high performing team.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage individual contributor performance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deliver results across team KPIs and org level OKRs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify and implement process-improvement opportunities; such as systems efficiency gains and leaning into data resulting in increased automation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead from the front with a willingness to get hands dirty.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Champion, role model, and embed Samsara’s cultural principles (Focus on Customer Success, Build for the Long Term, Adopt a Growth Mindset, Be Inclusive, Win as a Team) as we scale globally and across new offices.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
