&lt;p&gt;Samsara&#39;s Sales Enablement team equips our sellers with the skills, knowledge, and content they need to deliver differentiated value to customers and meet ambitious revenue goals. We&#39;re looking for a Manager, Sales Enablement - Learning Design to lead our Learning Experience Design (LXD) and Content Developer team. In this role, you&#39;ll set the strategy and quality bar for how Samsara designs, builds, and delivers learning experiences and sales content, while growing a talented team of instructional designers and content developers.&lt;/p&gt;
