&lt;li&gt;Deep understanding of Salesforce.com (SFDC) and MEDDIC/MEDDPICC&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong strategic problem-solving, project management, interpersonal, and team management skills&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven track record of overachievement, including experience coaching a team on outbounding&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with a Proof of Concept or Trial sales motion&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfort giving upward feedback&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
