&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bachelor&#39;s in Statistics, Computer Science, Business, Economics or other related analytical fields.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;5+ years of relevant analytics, business intelligence, artificial intelligence or data engineering work experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Expert in SQL, python, DBT and visualization platforms (Tableau preferred).&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on experience working with Databricks (or similar lakehouse architectures) to transform and model large datasets.&lt;/li&gt;
