&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design and build end-to-end Connected Workflows features across web, mobile, backend services, and platform integrations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead technical projects from discovery through rollout, including architecture, implementation, testing, observability, and launch.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Improve the scalability, reliability, and extensibility of the Connected Workflows platform as usage grows across customers and product areas.&lt;/li&gt;
