&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Cloud Scale Expertise:&lt;/strong&gt; Proven experience working with web services at massive scale deployed on Cloud providers such as AWS or Azure.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Communication:&lt;/strong&gt; Excellent collaboration and problem-solving skills, with a demonstrated ability to manage complex technical discussions with stakeholders across Legal, Hardware, and Product.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;A &quot;Founder-Engineer&quot; mindset:&lt;/strong&gt; You’ve built and shipped a 0-1 product from scratch and successfully navigated the &quot;morass&quot; of scaling it into a mature business driver.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Applied AI Power-User:&lt;/strong&gt; You have fully transitioned to an AI-native workflow to &quot;code at the speed of thought.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;An ideal candidate also has:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
