&lt;p&gt;Samsara is aware of scams involving fake job interviews and offers. Please know we do not charge fees to applicants at any stage of the hiring process. Official communication about your application will only come from emails ending in @samsara.com, @us-greenhouse-mail.io or @mail3.guide.co. For more information regarding fraudulent employment offers, please visit our&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://samsara.com/blog/avoiding-fake-job-offers&quot;&gt;blog post here&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who we are&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 300; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Samsara (NYSE: IOT) is the pioneer of the Connected Operations™ Cloud, which is a platform that enables organizations that depend on physical operations to harness Internet of Things (IoT) data to develop actionable insights and improve their operations. At Samsara, we are helping improve the safety, efficiency and sustainability of the physical operations that power our global economy. Representing more than 40% of global GDP, these industries are the infrastructure of our planet, including agriculture, construction, field services, transportation, and manufacturing — and we are excited to help digitally transform their operations at scale.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 300; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Working at Samsara means you’ll help define the future of physical operations and be on a team that’s shaping an exciting array of product solutions, including Video-Based Safety, Vehicle Telematics, Apps and Driver Workflows, and Equipment Monitoring. As part of a recently public company, you’ll have the autonomy and support to make an impact as we build for the long term.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the role:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are seeking a results-driven professional passionate about the seamless execution of supply chain operations. In this high-impact role, you will bridge the gap between our US operations and our Taiwan-based Supply Chain team. By collaborating with Material Management, Global Operational Engineering, WW Planning, and VMI partners, you will play a critical role in hitting supply targets and revenue goals. As a key US-based resource, you will ensure 24-hour continuity and provide essential SCM support during US business hours.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is a remote position open to candidates residing in the Western or Central United States (Pacific, Mountain, and Central Time Zones), capable of working hours adapted to the US daytime with a necessary overlap with the Taiwan team&#39;s early morning hours. This position requires travel up to 10% of the time.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Relocation assistance will not be provided for this role.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This role is open to candidates residing in the US &lt;strong&gt;except&lt;/strong&gt; the San Francisco Bay Metro Area, NYC Metro Area, and Washington, D.C. Metro Area.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You should apply if:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You want to impact the industries that run our world:&lt;/strong&gt; Your efforts will result in real-world impact – helping to keep the lights on, get food into grocery stores, reduce emissions, and most importantly, ensure workers return home safely.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You are the architect of your own career:&lt;/strong&gt; If you put in the work, this role won’t be your last at Samsara. We set up our employees for success and have built a culture that encourages rapid career development, countless opportunities to experiment and master your craft in a hyper growth environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You’re energized by our opportunity:&lt;/strong&gt; The vision we have to digitize large sectors of the global economy requires your full focus and best efforts to bring forth creative, ambitious ideas for our customers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You want to be with the best:&lt;/strong&gt; At Samsara, we win together, celebrate together and support each other. You&lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;will be surrounded by a high-calibre team that will encourage you to do your best.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;In this role, you will:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Global Continuity &amp;amp; US Coverage:&lt;/strong&gt; Serve as the primary US-based SCM representative to ensure seamless, 24-hour operational continuity, specializing in &lt;strong&gt;Inbound Supply, VMI operations, and HEM supply management.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;End-to-End Supply Execution:&lt;/strong&gt; Oversee inbound supply chain operations, including forecast releases, PR/PO processing, and logistics coordination, ensuring all shipments meet rigorous timeframes and revenue targets.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Production &amp;amp; Material Optimization:&lt;/strong&gt; Provide critical insights into production capacity and material visibility while driving BOM ordering elasticity and MRD reporting to optimize supply with JDM partners.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Cross-Functional Bridge:&lt;/strong&gt; cross-view the implementation of ECO changes and collaborate with suppliers and internal teams to resolve production gaps and alleviate supply constraints through proactive technical coordination.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Executive Communication:&lt;/strong&gt; fluent communication and professional presentation skills to influence executive-level stakeholders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Champion, role model, and embed Samsara’s cultural principles (Focus on Customer Success, Build for the Long Term, Adopt a Growth Mindset, Be Inclusive, Win as a Team) as we scale globally and across new offices.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Minimum requirements for the role:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Supply Chain &amp;amp; Fulfillment Expertise:&lt;/strong&gt; 6+ years of experience in supply chain execution, including direct supplier management, material/manufacturing capacity planning, and refurbishment. Proficient in managing &lt;strong&gt;CTB (Clear to Build)&lt;/strong&gt; reports, OPO backlog tracking, and material shortage mitigation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Operational Systems &amp;amp; Technical Literacy:&lt;/strong&gt; Strong working knowledge of &lt;strong&gt;ERP, PLM, and ASCP&lt;/strong&gt; systems. Familiarity with hardware-specific processes like &lt;strong&gt;BOM management, Costing, and ECO&lt;/strong&gt; is highly valued.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Strategic Reporting &amp;amp; Analysis:&lt;/strong&gt; Proven ability to consolidate supply elasticity data and deliver high-level analytics to &lt;strong&gt;Executive leadership&lt;/strong&gt;. Capable of translating complex task simulations into actionable solutions and formal presentations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Cross-Functional collaboration:&lt;/strong&gt; Exceptional communication skills with a track record of interacting cross-functional teams. Demonstrated ability to implement programs across diverse stakeholder groups and sponsor new process establishments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Agile Project Management:&lt;/strong&gt; Highly organized with a &quot;passion for risk mitigation&quot; and number sensitivity. Able to prioritize and delegate effectively within high-paced, high-growth environments to ensure program schedules are met.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;An ideal candidate also has:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fluency in Mandarin (Traditional/Taiwanese) is a plus to international stakeholders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
