&lt;li&gt;Facilitate the sourcing process end to end: cost-benefit analyses, contract review, and vendor negotiations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Help develop and execute category strategies that align with business priorities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Monitor supplier performance and partner with internal stakeholders to facilitate business reviews&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Assure stakeholder alignment to drive the right business solutions and pricing&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deliver win-win outcomes with internal and external partners in vendor negotiations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Balance speed, quality, and risk with cost savings goals in a fast-paced environment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage projects related to Strategic Sourcing process, tools, and functional improvements&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Champion, role model, and embed Samsara&#39;s cultural principles (Focus on Customer Success, Build for the Long Term, Adopt a Growth Mindset, Be Inclusive, Win as a Team) as we scale globally&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Champion, role model, and embed Samsara’s cultural principles (Focus on Customer Success, Build for the Long Term, Adopt a Growth Mindset, Be Inclusive, Win as a Team) as we scale globally and across new offices&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Minimum requirements for the role:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;3-5&amp;nbsp; years of sourcing, procurement, finance, or related business experience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bachelor&#39;s degree in business, supply chain, or related discipline preferred&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong communication and influencing skills — you drive alignment without relying on authority&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fluent in financial analysis including cost modeling, total cost of ownership, and build vs. buy frameworks&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Able to manage a high volume of work in a fast-paced environment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
