&lt;li&gt;Bachelor&#39;s degree in a technical or business field, or equivalent practical work experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;AI Platform Experience: Proven experience managing AI support tools or LLM-based platforms (e.g., Decagon, Happy Robot, Intercom Fin, or similar).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Established subject matter expert in GTM tooling, with a history of delivering substantial impact across multiple tools&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to translate complex customer and business problems into clear requirements and solutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with leveraging AI to solve high-impact business problems&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Analytical Skills: Ability to look at large datasets of conversation logs to identify patterns and root causes of technical failures.&lt;/li&gt;
