&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Experience working with different countries of the LATAM regions preferred, but not required.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
